From: Numerio <b.vitruvio@gmail.com>
Subject: do not run mimeset from the AddResources action
Forwarded: not-needed
Author: Numerio <b.vitruvio@gmail.com>
Description:
 mimeset stamps the filesystem mime attributes and needs a running
 V\OS session; it cannot run while a package is built in a build
 container, and its failure would fail every jam build. Resource
 embedding through xres is unaffected, and the package ships a desktop
 entry for menu integration.

--- a/Jamrules
+++ b/Jamrules
@@ -2,5 +2,4 @@
 
 actions AddResources {
 	xres -o $(1) $(2)
-	mimeset -f $(1)
 }
